WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.680
Give the service team a clear picture so
they can help with the next step.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:06.405
Match the delivery paperwork to the order
and take a look at the shipment as it

00:00:06.405 --> 00:00:08.580
arrives.

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:13.340
Note the order, affected item, quantity and
what you see. Take a photo of the full

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:17.550
item and a few close-ups that make the
issue easy to understand.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.110
Add any receiving notes required by the
factory or carrier, and report the issue

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:24.120
promptly. Check their reporting
instructions and deadlines while the
details are

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:27.130
fresh.

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:30.943
Keep the paperwork, photos and replies
together. Note who is helping and the next

00:00:30.943 --> 00:00:34.207
update. Continue tracking the kitchen
through installation and any parts needed
to

00:00:34.207 --> 00:00:37.470
finish the job.
